20:17:57.096432 105:   // Convert the data to actual temperature                  | D:\Arduino_GitHub\Termometer\Termometer.ino:98                          
20:17:57.096432 106:   // because the result is a 16 bit signed integer, it shoul | D:\Arduino_GitHub\Termometer\Termometer.ino:99                          
